# Keep the engine image lean and secret-free (R391; R399 W1).
# The webapp builds separately on Vercel; .env.keys must NEVER enter
# an image (Render env vars are the hosted credential path).
TOSCANINI_UI/webapp/node_modules
TOSCANINI_UI/webapp/.next
TOSCANINI_UI/previews
.env.keys
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
TOSCANINI_UI/webapp/out
TOSCANINI_UI/webapp-export

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R399 W1: the production image carries ONLY what the runtime imports and
# serves. Measured archaeology (du, verified zero runtime imports per dir):
#   ENGINE_RUNS/            88 MB — runtime WRITES (recreated on demand);
#                           tracked archaeology lives in git history + the
#                           runtime-state branch, never in the image
#   experiments/            25 MB — CI/test instrumentation corpora
#   tournament_v3/          15 MB — CI regression corpora (V3 replay AIC)
#   artifacts/benchmark/    14 MB — benchmark instrumentation records
#   ENGINE_RUNS_ARCHIVE_R376_BEFORE/ 13 MB — archive of an archive
#   external_corpora/       6.2 MB — offline snapshot script inputs
#   discovery_campaigns/    (archived subdirs only; the runtime seed
#                           campaign TOSCANINI_6DOMAIN_* is KEPT below)
#   CEREVASC_*              ~10 MB — superseded invention snapshots
#                           (git history preserves every version)
#   R3xx dirs               ~10 MB — round-era records
#   TTP_PACKAGES/           2.1 MB — superseded TTP skeletons
#   EXTERNAL_CONSULTANT_EVIDENCE/ 3.4 MB, RELEASE_CHAIN/, canonical_data/,
#   elite_v3/, scripts_v25_t6v2/, scripts_v6_v4_v3_2l/, engine/ (W6 archive)
#
# Tests, CI workflows and docs do not run inside the container.
# Runtime-KEPT (verified live references): toscanini/, discovery_fabric/,
# orchestrator/, epistemic_integrity/, premium_package_factory/,
# scripts/, TOSCANINI/, inventions/, MECHANISM_CEMETERY/,
# external_evidence/, patent_sources/, MULTI_SOURCE_DISCOVERY/,
# discovery_campaigns/TOSCANINI_6DOMAIN_2026-08-30 (the public demo
# seed), artifacts/source_health (runtime read/write), quarantine/,
# mechanisms/, requirements.txt, DEPLOYMENT_CONFIG.json.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ENGINE_RUNS
experiments
tournament_v3
artifacts/benchmark
ENGINE_RUNS_ARCHIVE_R376_BEFORE
external_corpora
canonical_data
TTP_PACKAGES
EXTERNAL_CONSULTANT_EVIDENCE
RELEASE_CHAIN
CEREVASC_*
elite_v3
scripts_v25_t6v2
scripts_v6_v4_v3_2l
engine
R3[0-9][0-9][0-9]*
BENCHMARK_ENGINEERING_DOSSIERS
discovery_campaigns/CAMPAIGN_L8_2026-08-29
discovery_campaigns/M1_DOSSIER_CAMPAIGN_2026-08-29
discovery_campaigns/R375_NEW_INVENTION_CAMPAIGN_2026-08-30
tests
.github
*.md
worklog.md
# R436: the CONSTITUTION rides in the image — /api/version reports its
# ratified version (Direction 1: constitution_version is part of the
# production identity). One 60 KB governance file, not round-era
# archaeology; the *.md lean-image directive (R399 W1) targeted the
# latter. NOTE: ARTIFACT_IDENTITY.json below stays excluded — the
# Dockerfile bakes it AFTER the copy, from the actual built commit
# (env vars can never define the identity, R396 A.3).
!EPISTEMIC_CONSTITUTION.md
ARTIFACT_IDENTITY.json
ARTIFACT_IDENTITY.sha256
ENGINE_COMMIT.txt
*.log
# NOTE: .git is deliberately NOT ignored — the Dockerfile's identity
# bake falls back to the build context's git HEAD when no
# RENDER_GIT_COMMIT build-arg is supplied (R396 A.3 priority 2; the
# fallback source must reach the build).
